        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Seán Smyth\n- Places: Straide, County Mayo, Galway, Ireland, Connacht\n- Roles: All-Ireland champion\n- Products: fiddle, whistle\n- Organizations: Róisín Dubh\n- Topics: live music venues\n\nFacts:\n- Galway is a city in the West of Ireland in the province of Connacht.\n- Seán Smyth was born in Straide, County Mayo, and now lives in Galway.\n- Seán Smyth is an All-Ireland champion on both fiddle and whistle.\n- The Róisín Dubh is an established live music venue in Galway, Ireland.",
